Golden vectors are inlined in FsmDerivationGoldenTest (NAME_GOLDEN 3 rows,
QUERY_GOLDEN 5 rows) as language-neutral JSON — kept in-test to stay within this
slice's allowed file scope (apps/shared/core/**); the C# Windows port mirrors the
identical rows so KMP and C# cannot drift (ADR-004). The FSM feeds carry no typed
model (state names / triggers / counts / timestamps / pagination ints — not
unit-bearing), so payloads round-trip verbatim as raw JsonElement; there is no
display conversion and no separate spec/ fixture or GoldenLoader expect/actual.
